      "text": "🛍️ On Sunday, Nam went shopping in town with his mum. They took the bus at nine o'clock. Nam wanted new trainers for school."
    },
    {
      "id": "p2",
      "text": "First, they went to the shoe shop. The trainers were thirty dollars. Nam tried on a white pair, but they were too small."
    },
    {
      "id": "p3",
      "text": "Then the shop assistant brought a bigger pair. They were blue and very comfortable. 'I like these!' said Nam. His mum paid for them."
    },
    {
      "id": "p4",
      "text": "Next, they walked to the supermarket. Mum bought rice, eggs, milk and some fruit. Nam carried the heavy bag."
    },
    {
      "id": "p5",
      "text": "🍦 After shopping, they were tired. They went to a café near the bank. Nam had an ice cream and Mum had a cup of tea."
    },
    {
      "id": "p6",
      "text": "On the way home, Nam saw a bookshop. He bought a comic with his own money. It was only two dollars."
    }
